riggers the combat escape without failing the mission, runners can bypass the puzzle minigame for a substantial split optimization.\r\n189: \r\n190: ### C. Motel Confrontation Skip\r\n191: - **Mission**: `BIL_MOTEL` — *Checking Out (Starlet Motel Climax)*\r\n192: - **Branch Rows in `CMissions`**:\r\n193:   - `BIL_MOTEL_NON_VIOLENT` (Unique Index 115)\r\n194:   - `BIL_MOTEL_VIOLENT` (Unique Index 116)\r\n195: - **Any% Opportunity**:\r\n196:   - Runners should benchmark dialogue skippability in `NON_VIOLENT` versus immediate gunplay takedown in `VIOLENT` to lock down the faster split.\r\n197: \r\n198: ### D. Chapter 1 Compound Skip Potential (`MTL_WAKE` Barrier Sweep)\r\n199: - **Engine Evidence**:\r\n200:   - When `MTL_WAKE` is processed, `func_10AA55` lines 572964..573008 automatically asserts the completion flags for all Kingfishers compound missions (`COM_KBOS_SHOP`, `COM_KBOS_COLAT`, `COM_KBOS_RADR`, `COM_KBOS_NEIGHB`, `COM_KBOS_CLEAN`) and Donnie package checks.\r\n201: - **Any% Route Opportunity**:\r\n202:   - If the engine permits triggering the transition sequence without finishing every Kingfishers side compound, runners can bypass up to 5 compound side jobs in Chapter 1.\r\n203: \r\n204: ---\r\n205: \r\n206: ## 4. Replay Menu Cross-Mission Links (Confirmed Engine Reveal Links)\r\n207: \r\n208: | Replay Menu Entry | In-Game Name | Keyed Unlock Mission | In-Game Name | Evaluator |\r\n209: |---|---|---|---|---|\r\n210: | `BIL_PICK` | Swamped | `BIL_WHEEL` | Doin' Gone | `uiUnlockEvaluatorMission` |\r\n211: | `BIL_HOUSE` | Find Donnie's Package | `BIL_WHEEL` | Doin' Gone | `uiUnlockEvaluatorMission` |\r\n212: | `BAN_SETUP` | Sinfrontera Bank Scope | `BAN_RESCU` | The Missing Link | `uiUnlockEvaluatorMission` |\r\n213: | `MNY_HOTEL` | Ocean Beach (Y Hotel) | `SFH_TAXI` | Another Life | `uiUnlockEvaluatorMission` |\r\n214: \r"}
